  "scientific_review": [
    "All ten original Atlantic SEC section/date cases remain as two eastward SEUC regional cases with ten anchors,including unselected,gate/support-edge or primary-censored cases. Fully unsupported dated cases remain unresolved. Frozen adjacent-only interpolation never skips gaps or extrapolates; connectors are not measured current lengths.",
    "Declare before fields: five source stops ordered eastward35,34,33,32,31W,with only original native columns5.5–2.5S inside source6.5–1.5S windows. Exact subset-to-original index mapping and original raw-profile pointers are retained. These exploratory gates are not published axes,widths or errors. Meanders and branches outside the gate remain unsearched.",
    "Complete original sections are audited under pinned current:atlantic-south-equatorial,original270degree westward component and frozen selection/geometry. Recompute90degree eastward velocity from raw east/north components,keeping either missing component missing. The new undercurrent owner/frame is explicit;no original array metadata,diagnosis,selection or numeric depth is relabeled or inherited. Family-level SEC receives no measurement.",
    "Frozen interval selector requires finite complete native100–400m support,positive signed integral and core above10cm/s,with no surface-speed gate. First southern native index wins ties;selected gate/support-edge maxima stay unresolved without weaker interior replacement. All5/10/20cm/s layers use the selected column with their own qualifying seed. Cutoffs are diagnostic definitions rather than confidence limits.",
    "Fresh Assuncao2023 publisher text distinguishes offshore SEUC/cSEC from coastal NBC/NBUC and separate2015/2017 campaigns. Molinari1981 retained primary facts and fresh primary indexed text provide historical3–5S core context;direct PDF reopen403. Fresh primary indexed Schott2003/2005 descriptions distinguish thermocline SEUC from deeper intermediate eastward flow;direct publisher reopens403. These sources are context rather than2022 axis,depth or seasonal validation. No source figures or arrays extracted.",
    "Neither100m nor400m is an imposed top/bottom. Search the full0–5000m native axis for adjacent finite brackets. Same-sign intermediate flow can connect and cannot be independently separated as SEUC water by these velocity layers. Keep upper/lower depths,statuses,brackets,supported bounds and paired spans distinct. Instrument/plot/transport limits,core locations and thermocline depths are not current edges. No thermal,salinity,density or source-water assignment applies.",
    "Thin derived report retains all candidate scores,selected diagnostics,original byte pins/indices and a separately typed selected90degree component. Raw component/profile pointers target unchanged originals;derived velocity/layer pointers target the report. This is same-field reanalysis rather than independent observational evidence;original westward cases remain unchanged and comparison groups are distinct.",
    "Thirty-four cloud tests in groups12/10/12 cover frozen connected layers and interval math,source-to-inventory pipeline,opposite-frame recomputation,null handling,subset boundaries/raw-index mapping,subsurface flow with nonzero top and bottom below400m,definition/source/report mutations,adjacency and censoring,piece/count/input pins and unchanged caps. Six baseline tests pass on the exact code commit.",
    "Immutable v14 base,sixteen earlier addenda,all106 earlier scenarios,historical unresolved cases,every old CSV cell and canonical depth-reference ownership remain preserved. Prior derived reports including WSC and AZCC remain pinned. Inventoryv17 adds one pinned addendum/CSV and thin report without changing original sources or frozen numerical helpers.",
    "All source audits,component/interval/contour calculations,geometry,interpolation,inventory reconstruction and tests ran sequentially in cloud on one idle CPU. Local work was code preparation,primary text/metadata review,hashes and exact artifact retention. No new provider reads,local numerical field processing/tests or runtime/UI/browser work. Audit-plus-subset250000pair/7MB limits and publication caps are unchanged.",
    "Geographic eastward maxima can be neighboring circulation or eddies and do not independently identify a coherent named current. Paired model span is not established physical thickness. Two snapshots do not establish annual/seasonal envelopes,confidence bounds,physical whole-route depths,matched areas,volumes,state intersections or global sums. Remaining current coverage,observational/seasonal validation and runtime/query integration remain unfinished."
  ],
